      "text": "Hahahahahahah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 17.1,
      "end_time": 21.6,
      "text": "Behold the world's mightiest supervillain, the great Novem!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 22.3,
      "end_time": 25.3,
      "text": "Hmmm... I haven't done this in a while,"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 25.5,
      "end_time": 29.3,
      "text": "so I'm having trouble getting back into the swing of it."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 32.3,
      "end_time": 36.3,
      "text": "Uhhh, what's a good villainous thing to say?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 38.8,
      "end_time": 42.1,
      "text": "Draw, if you be men! I bite my thumb at you, sir!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 42.6,
      "end_time": 43.8,
      "text": "...Uh, maybe not."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 44.3,
      "end_time": 45.6,
      "text": "Oh well, whatever!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 49.8,
      "end_time": 53.0,
      "text": "Step aside, step aside! Villain coming through!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 53.3,
      "end_time": 57.3,
      "text": "Anyone in my way gets a taste of my Spiresbane Blade!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 58.3,
      "end_time": 58.6,
      "text": "Wahahahah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 59.1,
      "end_time": 59.7,
      "text": "Tremble!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 60.0,
      "end_time": 60.5,
      "text": "Scream!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 60.8,
      "end_time": 62.3,
      "text": "Beg for your lives!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 65.3,
